<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>出版物 |皮尤研究中心</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/publications/</link><description>塑造您世界的数字、事实和趋势</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:41:59 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>许多以色列人和巴勒斯坦人表示他们无法和平共处 - 并解释原因</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/global/2026/09/15/many-israelis-and-palestinians-say-they-cannot-coexist-peacefully-and-explain-why/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/09/PG_26.09.15_Coexistance_featured@2x.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;西岸和东耶路撒冷的以色列人和巴勒斯坦人反思两国解决方案的可行性&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:41:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/global/2026/09/15/many-israelis-and-palestinians-say-they-cannot-coexist-peacefully-and-explain-why/</guid></item><item><title>约旦河西岸和东耶路撒冷大约十分之九的巴勒斯坦人认为以色列检查站是一个主要问题</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/09/15/about-9-in-10-palestinians-in-the-west-bank-and-east-jerusalem-see-israeli-checkpoints-as-a-major-problem/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/09/SR_26.09.15_west-bank-access_featured.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;约旦河西岸和东耶路撒冷的绝大多数巴勒斯坦人（85%）也表示，工作机会对他们及其家人来说是一个主要问题。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:41:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/09/15/about-9-in-10-palestinians-in-the-west-bank-and-east-jerusalem-see-israeli-checkpoints-as-a-major-problem/</guid></item><item><title>谁是西班牙裔？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/09/15/who-is-hispanic/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/09/SR_26.09.15_WhoIsHispanic_featured2x.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;如今，美国有超过 7000 万人被认定为拉美裔，但政府机构和调查机构并不以同样的方式计算拉美裔人口。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:41:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/09/15/who-is-hispanic/</guid></item><item><title>美国人重视新闻自由，但对其限制存在分歧</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/journalism/2026/09/15/americans-value-press-freedom-but-differ-on-its-limits/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/09/PJ_26.09.15_press-freedom_topic.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;许多美国人表示，考虑到对虚假信息或国家安全的担忧，一些新闻自由限制是可以接受的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:41:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/journalism/2026/09/15/americans-value-press-freedom-but-differ-on-its-limits/</guid></item><item><title>测验：您对第一修正案了解多少？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/journalism/quiz/how-much-do-you-know-about-the-first-amendment/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/09/PJ_26.09.15_press-freedom-quiz_topic.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;您对第一修正案（包括新闻自由和其他权利）了解多少？通过参加我们的测验来测试您的知识。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:41:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/journalism/quiz/how-much-do-you-know-about-the-first-amendment/</guid></item></channel></rss>